    {
      "name": "I’ve Got ’Em",
      "kind": "Passive",
      "rulesText": "Creatures Restrained by the Kneebreaker take double damage from attacks by other adversaries."
    },
    {
      "name": "Hold Them Down",
      "kind": "Action",
      "rulesText": "Make an attack against a target within Melee range. On a success, the target takes no damage but is Restrained and Vulnerable. The target can break free, clearing both conditions, with a successful Strength Roll or is freed automatically if the Kneebreaker takes Major or greater damage."
    }
